            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.53

- Fixed backward swipe previews showing the first played track after jumping several positions in a browser queue.
- Made the live YouTube Music queue relationship override local playback history.
- Prevented an incorrect cached cover from being committed briefly before the actual previous track arrives.
]]></description>
